  "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n <head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n  <script async=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n  </script>\n  <script>\n   window.MathJax = {\n                        tex: {\n                        inlineMath: [\n                            [\"$\", \"$\"],\n                            [\"\\\\(\", \"\\\\)\"],\n                        ],\n                        displayMath: [\n                            [\"$$\", \"$$\"],\n                            [\"\\\\[\", \"\\\\]\"],\n                        ],\n                        processEscapes: true,\n                        processEnvironments: true,\n                        },\n                        options: {\n                        skipHtmlTags: [\"script\", \"noscript\", \"style\", \"textarea\", \"pre\"],\n                        },\n                    };\n                    if(window.MathJax && window.MathJax.typeset) {\n                        MathJax.Hub.Queue([\"Typeset\", MathJax.Hub]);\n                    }\n  </script>\n  <style>\n   table {\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        width: 100%;\n        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n        }\n        thead tr th {\n        border-top: 2px solid #000;\n        border-bottom: 2px solid #000;\n        padding: 8px;\n        background: #f6f6f6;\n        }\n        tbody td {\n        border-bottom: 1px solid #aaa;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: center;\n        }\n  </style>\n </head>\n <body>\n  <p><img alt=\"behold\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/00ab595d2f3521960fd5901014ac4433521260ff.png\"/></p>\n  <hr/>\n  <p>Assorted Allays 是希望获得更多样性的玩家的完美资源包，它拥有200多个自定义变体。这个版本包含了来自FreshLX的Fresh Animations资源包的自定义动画！</p>\n  <p><img alt=\"banner\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5894088237e8c5164eb150892d1ee268befe4665.png\"/></p>\n  <p><img alt=\"addon\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/478a94a0cfc1ccfdcd5594cb9fd0ea995deb1003.png\"/></p>\n  <hr/>\n  <p>此资源包需要以下提到的模组：</p>\n  <p><img alt=\"Optifine or EMF/ETF\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1ad839ff3ba39226c2e38561fed87845e8314a22_0.webp\"/></p>\n  <p><img alt=\"Features\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7925f8af6bb75eb904febe9b92c84a6c902ba4d7.png\"/></p>\n  <hr/>\n  <p>这些生物变体都可以重命名为相应的皮肤并自然生成。本资源包的格式设计用于轻松创建扩展组件！</p>\n  <p><img alt=\"Allay Thumbnail\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/71e8f0a9dd8a85f4cdcf6a895a554554d3b111d9.png\"/></p>\n  <p><img alt=\"notes\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ae7040573760b45a4840469e65396ef3f07c4896.png\"/></p>\n  <hr/>\n  <p>以下资源包必须以如下方式格式化：</p>\n  <p><img alt=\"allay_order\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/08e4108ca6c915c723affac215d7fea8f8bf09f6.png\"/></p>\n  <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6mb4QDE.png\"/></p>\n  <hr/>\n  <p><a href=\"discord.gg/kYYmAWQ\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"discord_link\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0f2d9f2c414441c5741f635153fc6820f884bfd9_0.webp\"/></a></p>\n  <p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d3078\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Spark_server\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6bcd4c7a1170269c7c6f9422f2bc574184de8942.jpeg\"/></a></p>\n  <p><img alt=\"license\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eda2698ccdd602757b99afcb8431a6e875e5ea2f.png\"/></p>\n  <hr/>\n  <p><strong>Fresh Animions由FreshLX拥有和分发</strong></p>\n  <p><strong>所有非我原创的素材均已获得原作者授权使用！</strong></p>\n  <p><img alt=\"License\" src=\"https://licensebuttons.net/l/by-nc-sa/3.0/88x31.png\"/></p>\n  <p><strong>本内容采用署名-非商业性使用-相同方式共享 4.0 国际许可协议进行授权。</strong></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
